From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] apklayer compat: -std=c++2b for gcc before 13

gcc 11 and 12 (Ubuntu 22.04) do not know --std=c++23; c++2b is the same draft standard.
Applied by scripts/build-bionic-translation.sh only when the compiler is gcc older than 13.
---
diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index d741726..e1ced47 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -155,7 +155,7 @@ stdcpp_bio = shared_library('stdc++_bio',
 		'libstdc++_standalone/include/'
 	],
 	cpp_args: [
-		'--std=c++23'
+		'--std=c++2b'
 	]
 )
 
